Package: subart2
Type: Package
Title: subart2: Faster Multivariate Bayesian Additive Regression Trees for Multiple Outcomes
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mateus", "Maia", email = "mateus.maiamarques.2021@mumail.ie",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7056-386X")),
    person("Jonas", "Esser", email = "j.esser@vu.nl", role = c("ctb")))
Description: A high-performance refactoring of the 'subart' package implementing
    Bayesian Additive Regression Trees (BART) for multiple outcomes under the
    seemingly unrelated regression framework. The modular C++ architecture and
    optimised bivariate path provide substantially faster sampling than the
    original implementation. Handles continuous and binary multivariate responses
    as well as missing outcome data.
